{"2446760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "YASUKE: A Lost Descendant", "steam_appid": 2446760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YASUKE: A Lost Descendant</strong> is a kinetic 3D anime action game where you strike with purpose and move with style. Play as Tanaka Yasuke, a young hero discovering his legacy as the heir to the legendary African samurai. Battle across the futuristic nation of N10N-KOKU using high-velocity parkour, dynamic swordplay, and supernatural power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/f9470ef4790e97bf39fe571235f956f2.avif?t=1784832009\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras_big/f9470ef4790e97bf39fe571235f956f2.avif?t=1784832009 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SLASH WITH STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your fighting style with three distinct combat stances — Lion, Cheetah, and Rhino — each with its own rhythm and intent. Chain combos, unleash devastating STYLE attacks, and adapt to each fight with fluid precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/9c4423fd5b1411b722ae3dd6a26fdb28.poster.avif?t=1784832009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/9c4423fd5b1411b722ae3dd6a26fdb28.webm?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/9c4423fd5b1411b722ae3dd6a26fdb28.mp4?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>MOVE WITH VELOCITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run walls, grind rails, and glide across rooftops in a world built for motion. Your parkour-infused maneuvers aren't just how you move – they're how you fight. Build momentum and turn it into a weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/8a044ef003c14b63f8a16d23cae44797.poster.avif?t=1784832009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/8a044ef003c14b63f8a16d23cae44797.webm?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/8a044ef003c14b63f8a16d23cae44797.mp4?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>CHANNEL YOUR LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the Shiryoku, a mysterious force that lets you manipulate your environment. Pull debris, hurl projectiles, swing through the air, and reshape the battlefield to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/33293ef28fa4b2a0279a741f4715c29a.poster.avif?t=1784832009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/33293ef28fa4b2a0279a741f4715c29a.webm?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/33293ef28fa4b2a0279a741f4715c29a.mp4?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>CLAIM YOUR FUTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vibrant districts of N10N-KOKU — a futuristic nation pulsing with global culture, anime-inspired style, and high-stakes conflict. Face rival clans, bond with your teammates, and fight for a future built on rhythm, rebellion, and legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/66ef53f77d7201aaae985b514d0c5b9e.poster.avif?t=1784832009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/66ef53f77d7201aaae985b514d0c5b9e.webm?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/66ef53f77d7201aaae985b514d0c5b9e.mp4?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YASUKE: A Lost Descendant</strong> is a kinetic 3D anime action game where you strike with purpose and move with style. Play as Tanaka Yasuke, a young hero discovering his legacy as the heir to the legendary African samurai. Battle across the futuristic nation of N10N-KOKU using high-velocity parkour, dynamic swordplay, and supernatural power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/f9470ef4790e97bf39fe571235f956f2.avif?t=1784832009\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras_big/f9470ef4790e97bf39fe571235f956f2.avif?t=1784832009 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SLASH WITH STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your fighting style with three distinct combat stances — Lion, Cheetah, and Rhino — each with its own rhythm and intent. Chain combos, unleash devastating STYLE attacks, and adapt to each fight with fluid precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/9c4423fd5b1411b722ae3dd6a26fdb28.poster.avif?t=1784832009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/9c4423fd5b1411b722ae3dd6a26fdb28.webm?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/9c4423fd5b1411b722ae3dd6a26fdb28.mp4?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>MOVE WITH VELOCITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run walls, grind rails, and glide across rooftops in a world built for motion. Your parkour-infused maneuvers aren't just how you move – they're how you fight. Build momentum and turn it into a weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/8a044ef003c14b63f8a16d23cae44797.poster.avif?t=1784832009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/8a044ef003c14b63f8a16d23cae44797.webm?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/8a044ef003c14b63f8a16d23cae44797.mp4?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>CHANNEL YOUR LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the Shiryoku, a mysterious force that lets you manipulate your environment. Pull debris, hurl projectiles, swing through the air, and reshape the battlefield to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/33293ef28fa4b2a0279a741f4715c29a.poster.avif?t=1784832009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/33293ef28fa4b2a0279a741f4715c29a.webm?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/33293ef28fa4b2a0279a741f4715c29a.mp4?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>CLAIM YOUR FUTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vibrant districts of N10N-KOKU — a futuristic nation pulsing with global culture, anime-inspired style, and high-stakes conflict. Face rival clans, bond with your teammates, and fight for a future built on rhythm, rebellion, and legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/66ef53f77d7201aaae985b514d0c5b9e.poster.avif?t=1784832009\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/66ef53f77d7201aaae985b514d0c5b9e.webm?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446760/extras/66ef53f77d7201aaae985b514d0c5b9e.mp4?t=1784832009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dash. Slash. Glide. Discover your legacy as the heir to a legendary African samurai in this high-velocity 3D action game, featuring futuristic swordplay, kinetic parkour, and anime-inspired action.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“...mix in ultimate attacks, team-based moves à la Hi-Fi Rush, and the vaulting, wall-running, and swinging we love from Assassin's Creed, and YASUKE: A Lost Descendant is shooting